@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的尸体被发现后不久——<br>手机就收到了典狱长的消息。|#0201Adv23_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『唉……收到一份报告。<br>　据说发生了一起令人痛心的凶杀案啊』|#0201Adv23_Narrative002|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『这到底是怎么回事……』|#0201Adv23_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『总之，请大家立即前往会客厅集合。<br>　不遵守者将会被看守带走……』|#0201Adv23_Narrative004|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然大家还在无所适从，<br>但我们只能服从出现在此的看守，别无他法……|#0201Adv23_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
