@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_35_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:会客厅里12名少女全都聚集在一起，<br>除了梅露露以外。|#0201Adv23_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一具明显死于他杀的尸体。大家应该都是第一次目睹吧。<br>当然，我也是。|#0201Adv23_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们每个人都脸色苍白。|#0201Adv23_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:真的发生了呢，凶杀案！|#0201Adv23_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……除了某人以外。|#0201Adv23_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,60 AppearanceAndTransition:5_1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:25 Duration:20
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:有的人在哭泣，<br>有的人在强忍呕吐感，<br>有的人一直发出小声的悲鸣。|#0201Adv23_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这些少女们看我的眼神……<br>明显变了。|#0201Adv23_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那眼神充满恐惧，<br>就像在看杀人犯一样——|#0201Adv23_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那是什么眼神……！）|#0201Adv23_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我因为极度不适<br>而想要对她们大吼。|#0201Adv23_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，即使仍然处于混乱之中，<br>我还是搞清楚了一些状况。|#0201Adv23_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我倒在了尸体所在的房间里。<br>而且全身沾满了白色颜料和飞溅的血迹，一副凄惨的样子。|#0201Adv23_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在不管我说什么，<br>　都只会加深她们的恐惧而已）|#0201Adv23_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且我的后脑勺遭受重击，<br>直到刚才还处于昏迷状态。|#0201Adv23_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从自己身上散发出的不详的血腥味，<br>让我胃中翻江倒海，头痛欲裂。|#0201Adv23_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——感觉糟透了。|#0201Adv23_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在只能静观事态发展……）|#0201Adv23_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Duration:0 Lazy:false

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:听到典狱长的扑翅声响起，<br>我们之间的气氛变得更加紧张。|#0201Adv23_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:唉……结果还是<br>发生了凶杀案……|#0201Adv23_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今晚，将会举行【魔女审判】。|#0201Adv23_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位务必从在押囚犯当中锁定杀人凶手的身份。<br>选中的人将以【魔女】的身份被处以死刑。|#0201Adv23_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们会用特殊方法行刑，<br>令不会轻易死亡的魔女永久地安息。<br>那会是非常……非常残酷的方法。|#0201Adv23_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:另外，有件事要向全体囚犯通告。<br>如果没有选出凶手，将会对所有人处刑。|#0201Adv23_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听完典狱长平淡地解释这些内容，<br>她们喧闹起来。|#0201Adv23_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:全员处决也太荒唐了哇……！|#0201Adv23_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，你这只臭鸟在胡说什么！！|#0201Adv23_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:与此同时，典狱长也显得很困惑，<br>歪着头开口说道。|#0201Adv23_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:我只是按照主人的命令，<br>转达这些早已定好的事项而已……<br>|#0201Adv23_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是，决定这些事项的人，也就是主人都被杀害了，<br>我也感到很惊讶，不知该如何是好。|#0201Adv23_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嘈杂声更加强烈了。|#0201Adv23_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（冰上梅露露向典狱长下达命令……！？）|#0201Adv23_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都还没有理解情况时，<br>奈叶香迈出一步说道。|#0201Adv23_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说，监牢管理方……<br>在背后牵线的【幕后黑手】，【魔女】的真实身份，<br>就是冰上梅露露？|#0201Adv23_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:大概就是这样吧……？|#0201Adv23_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; この時ナノカはミリアが黒幕だと疑っていて、
; メルル黒幕がまだかみ砕けず困惑している想定です。
; ========================================

; ＠備考◆呆然と

[PrintTextModified Text:……这样。原来是这样啊。|#0201Adv23_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（冰上梅露露……<br>　明明表现得那么会关心人，居然是魔女吗）|#0201Adv23_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:老实说，<br>我不知道该如何看待这件事。|#0201Adv23_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我和梅露露交谈过几次，<br>但并没有多亲密。|#0201Adv23_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，她被杀害的样子仍在我脑海中挥之不去，<br>即使听说她是邪恶一方，我的心还是隐隐作痛。|#0201Adv23_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（即使相处的时间这么短，原来也会产生感情……）|#0201Adv23_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

; ＠備考◆ぶつぶつひとりごと風

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然梅露露大人不在了，<br>但监牢的规定并不会因此消失……<br>只能像以前一样继续运营下去了。|#0201Adv23_Warden009| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ぶつぶつひとりごと風

[PrintTextModified Text:仔细想想，<br>这里几乎都是由我来管理的。<br>即使没有梅露露大人也能运转。|#0201Adv23_Warden010| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ぶつぶつひとりごと風

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定因为那个很会使唤鸟的上司消失了，<br>反而工作更顺畅了呢……|#0201Adv23_Warden011| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:一直在嘀咕着什么的典狱长<br>突然展开了翅膀。|#0201Adv23_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_10_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这是个好机会。<br>现在让我们引入之前就一直在准备的机制，<br>【先行投票】吧！|#0201Adv23_Warden012| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:先行、投票……？|#0201Adv23_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:是的。在调查之前先进行投票，<br>将最可疑的囚犯拘禁起来。|#0201Adv23_Warden013| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一来，调查期间就不会发生犯人做手脚的情况，<br>也更容易确定凶手。<br>也就是说审判能更早结束。|#0201Adv23_Warden014| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo

[PrintTextModified Text:你是想尽快结束吧？<br>嗯……我倒是能理解你的心情。|#0201Adv23_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:那么各位，<br>请拿出自己的手机，票选出心中认为最可疑的囚犯吧。|#0201Adv23_Warden015| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……等等等等。<br>这不是什么都没变吗。<br>反而更糟了吧……？|#0201Adv23_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

; ＠備考◆葛藤

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然手机确实带在身上……<br>但是……唔唔……对不起。|#0201Adv23_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们虽然犹豫不决，<br>但还是拿出了手机。|#0201Adv23_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只能呆呆地站在那里，<br>看着这一切。|#0201Adv23_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果搞什么先行投票的话，<br>　不管怎么想都——）|#0201Adv23_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

