[PrintTextModified Text:会客厅的大屏幕突然亮起来，<br>紧接着响起一阵滑稽的庆祝音效。|#0201Adv23_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:屏幕上显示的是……|#0201Adv23_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,5 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:由于获得了压倒性多数的投票，<br>最终决定是二阶堂希罗小姐！|#0201Adv23_Warden016| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们将拘禁你直到魔女审判开庭哦～。<br>那么就请各位<br>努力找出凶手吧。|#0201Adv23_Warden017| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

