[PrintTextModified Text:开、开什么玩笑——唔！|#0201Adv23_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,-20 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我的抗议声<br>被有着许多长长手臂的看守打断了。|#0201Adv23_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不仅被堵住了嘴，<br>双臂还被从腋下擒抱，动弹不得。|#0201Adv23_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnBlur ActorId:Jailer-Middle
