@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

; ＠備考◆心配

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……|#0201Adv23_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守的腕力非同寻常，<br>无论我如何挣扎都纹丝不动。|#0201Adv23_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这种状态下，<br>我瞪视着在场的所有少女。|#0201Adv23_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:噫……|#0201Adv23_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好可怕～|#0201Adv23_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我被选中了。|#0201Adv23_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被这里的少女们<br>认定为杀人凶手——【魔女】。|#0201Adv23_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（好啊……你们全都是我的敌人……！！）|#0201Adv23_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:胸中刚刚萌生的<br>那一丝情感碎片已经荡然无存。|#0201Adv23_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我被看守带走的同时，<br>用仿佛要射杀所有人的眼神一直瞪视着她们。|#0201Adv23_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

